==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[St. Dober]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Kid Tappa]] spawns.
**2 [[Red EnerG]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
**4 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**4 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage features St. Dober with Red EnerG as the main support. Try to Freeze lock St. Dober with [[Master of Mind Soractes (Special Cat)|Master of Mind Soractes]], then use him as a platform for your [[Immune to Surge|Surge Immune]] units like [[Ancient Egg: N000 (Special Cat)|Ape Lord Luza]], [[Elder Beast Naala (Special Cat)|Awakened Naala]], [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]] to demolish both St. Dober and Red EnerG. Also make sure to use Surge Immune/strong meatshields like Talented [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]], and [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] for St. Dober.

==Trivia==
*Coral Housing and [[Kelp Campsite]] are designed like [[Uncanny Legends]] stages, [[Floating Bus Stop]] and [[Ink Museum]] are designed like late [[Stories of Legend]] stages, and [[Renovated Shipwreck]] and [[Jetsam Lookout]] are typical [[Zero Legends]] stages.

